OL,3,AHalf the harvest, twice the bills: how
OL,4,Adrought hit farms
OL,5,
OL,6,FI spent the summer watching farmers
OL,7,Finstall showers for cows, watch their
OL,8,Fcauliflowers burn to a crisp in the
OL,9,Fheat, and search for apples in cider
OL,10,Forchards reduced to a tenth of their
OL,11,Fnormal crop.
